<!--
  Ported from microsoft-ui-xaml (https://github.com/microsoft/microsoft-ui-xaml),
  commit 7e4b0c2096be402f51cc8f7d203ebf67cff183d0:
    controls/dev/CommonStyles/CommandBar_themeresources.xaml (DefaultCommandBarStyle,
    DefaultCommandBarOverflowPresenterStyle, EllipsisButton and the implicit styles of
    CommandBar and CommandBarOverflowPresenter; the resources are
    Resources/CommandBar_themeresources.xaml)
    controls/dev/CommonStyles/AppBarButton_themeresources.xaml (DefaultAppBarButtonStyle,
    AppBarButtonOverflowStyle and the implicit style of AppBarButton; the resources are
    Resources/AppBarButton_themeresources.xaml)
    controls/dev/CommonStyles/AppBarToggleButton_themeresources.xaml
    (DefaultAppBarToggleButtonStyle, AppBarToggleButtonOverflowStyle and the implicit style of
    AppBarToggleButton; the resources are Resources/AppBarToggleButton_themeresources.xaml)
    controls/dev/CommonStyles/AppBarSeparator_themeresources.xaml (DefaultAppBarSeparatorStyle and
    the implicit style of AppBarSeparator; the resources are
    Resources/AppBarSeparator_themeresources.xaml)
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. Licensed under the MIT License (see NOTICE.md of the crate).

  FerroUI's CommandBarButton, CommandBarToggleButton and CommandBarSeparator are WinUI's
  AppBarButton, AppBarToggleButton and AppBarSeparator.

  Translation notes (docs/porting/winui-theme.md, section 4):
  - The visual states the buttons choose in code (AppBarButtonHelpers::ChangeCommonVisualStates:
    Overflow before LabelOnRight before LabelCollapsed before Compact before FullSize) are the
    properties FerroUI's CommandBar sets on its elements: ^[IsCompact=True] (Compact),
    ^[LabelPosition=Collapsed] (LabelCollapsed), ^[LabelPosition=Right] (LabelOnRight, with the
    Width NaN of the code's storyboard) and ^[IsInOverflow=True] (Overflow, with the setters of
    AppBarButtonOverflowStyle and AppBarToggleButtonOverflowStyle that the overflow presenter
    applies), written in that order so that the state of WinUI wins; a later state sets back
    what an earlier one changed and it does not. FerroUI's CommandBar has no closed display
    mode: its buttons are in the FullSize state (labels under the icons) where WinUI's closed
    compact CommandBar shows them Compact (labels hidden until it opens).
  - The overflow variants OverflowWithToggleButtons, OverflowWithMenuIcons and
    OverflowWithToggleButtonsAndMenuIcons, which WinUI's CommandBar chooses from all its
    secondary commands, are left out: the overflow items are in the Overflow state (a toggle
    button in the overflow has its check glyph, as in WinUI). OverflowNormal, OverflowPointerOver
    and OverflowPressed of AppBarButton set what PointerOver and Pressed set; the Overflow*
    states of AppBarToggleButton are the nested styles of ^[IsInOverflow=True] after the
    others.
  - The icon is FerroUI's Icon in the Viewbox ContentViewbox (AppBarButtonContentHeight), a path
    icon there unscaled as WinUI's (PathIconUnscaledTemplate, DEVIATIONS.md PI-3). The
    KeyboardAcceleratorTextLabel, the flyout chevrons (SubItemChevronPanel, hidden in a command
    bar by AppBarButtonHasFlyoutChevronVisibility), InputModeStates and
    KeyboardAcceleratorTextVisibility are left out (FerroUI's command bar buttons have no
    accelerator text, flyout chevron or input mode). AllowFocusOnInteraction="False" is left
    out: FerroUI's CommandBar moves the keyboard focus between its buttons.
  - Border.BackgroundTransition is a BrushTransition of the background of the inner border.
  - The check glyph of the overflow toggle button (E73E in a TextBlock of 16 px, 14 x 14) is a
    path of GlyphGeometryE73E; the ellipsis of the More button (FontIcon E712 of 20 px whose
    height is AppBarExpandButtonCircleDiameter) is a path of GlyphGeometryE712, 15 x 3.
  - CommandBar: the ContentControl ContentControl is the PART_ContentPresenter, the ItemsControl
    PrimaryItemsControl shows VisiblePrimaryCommands, the Button MoreButton is the
    PART_OverflowButton (shown by IsOverflowButtonVisible), the Popup OverflowPopup the
    PART_OverflowPopup (open while IsOpen, under the bar and aligned with its right edge) and the
    CommandBarOverflowPresenter SecondaryItemsControl the ItemsControl PART_OverflowPresenter with
    the control theme DefaultCommandBarOverflowPresenterStyle, showing OverflowItems. The states
    of the open bar (CompactOpenUp, CompactOpenDown) are ^[IsOpen=True]; the clip and the
    translations of the bar and of the overflow content, their transitions and the Minimal and
    Hidden display modes are left out (FerroUI's CommandBar has no closed display modes). The
    drop shadow of the overflow content (ApplyElevationEffect on SecondaryItemsControlShadowWrapper,
    CommandBar_Partial.cpp: a ThemeShadow at a Translation.Z of 32) is the BoxShadow
    ThemeShadowFlyoutBoxShadow of SecondaryItemsControlShadowWrapper, with the margin
    ThemeShadowFlyoutMargin as its room in the popup (Resources/ThemeShadows.xaml; DEVIATIONS.md,
    G-24). AvailableCommandsStates and DynamicOverflowStates are left
    out: FerroUI's CommandBar computes its visible and overflow items in code.
  - FerroUI's CommandBar has no ContentTemplate, HorizontalContentAlignment and
    VerticalContentAlignment: the setters of the content alignments are left out and the content
    presenter is aligned left and top, their values. ClosedDisplayMode,
    ExitDisplayModeOnAccessKeyInvoked and CommandBarOverflowPresenterStyle (the overflow presenter
    has its theme in the template) have no counterpart. ItemWidthBottom and ItemWidthCollapsed,
    the widths FerroUI's CommandBar assumes for its items when it computes the dynamic overflow,
    are the Width of the buttons (68).
  - The Grid.Resources of the template (the opening and closing storyboards of the overlay, the
    styles of SplitButton in a command bar and AppBarButtonHasFlyoutChevronVisibility) are left
    out with what uses them.
-->
<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/ferroui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    x:ClassModifier="internal">
  <Design.PreviewWith>
    <Border Padding="20" Width="600">
      <CommandBar>
        <CommandBar.PrimaryCommands>
          <CommandBarButton Label="Add">
            <CommandBarButton.Icon>
              <PathIcon Data="M11,5H13V11H19V13H13V19H11V13H5V11H11Z" />
            </CommandBarButton.Icon>
          </CommandBarButton>
          <CommandBarSeparator />
          <CommandBarToggleButton Label="Checked" IsChecked="True">
            <CommandBarToggleButton.Icon>
              <PathIcon Data="M4,12.5L5.5,11L9.5,15L18.5,6L20,7.5L9.5,18Z" />
            </CommandBarToggleButton.Icon>
          </CommandBarToggleButton>
        </CommandBar.PrimaryCommands>
        <CommandBar.SecondaryCommands>
          <CommandBarButton Label="Settings" />
        </CommandBar.SecondaryCommands>
      </CommandBar>
    </Border>
  </Design.PreviewWith>

  <!-- AppBarButton -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="DefaultAppBarButtonStyle" TargetType="CommandBarButton">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBackground}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForeground}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBorderBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Top" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource ContentControlThemeFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Normal" />
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="68" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}" />
    <Setter Property="BackgroundSizing" Value="InnerBorderEdge" />
    <!-- UseSystemFocusVisuals with FocusVisualMargin="-3". -->
    <Setter Property="FocusAdorner">
      <FocusAdornerTemplate>
        <Border Margin="-3"
                BorderThickness="2"
                BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SystemControlFocusVisualPrimaryBrush}"
                CornerRadius="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}">
          <Border BorderThickness="1"
                  BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SystemControlFocusVisualSecondaryBrush}"
                  CornerRadius="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}" />
        </Border>
      </FocusAdornerTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel x:Name="Root" Background="Transparent">
          <Border x:Name="AppBarButtonInnerBorder"
                  Margin="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonInnerBorderMargin}"
                  Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                  BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                  BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                  BackgroundSizing="{TemplateBinding BackgroundSizing}">
            <Border.Transitions>
              <Transitions>
                <BrushTransition Property="Background" Duration="0:0:0.083" />
              </Transitions>
            </Border.Transitions>
          </Border>
          <Grid x:Name="ContentRoot"
                MinHeight="{DynamicResource AppBarThemeMinHeight}"
                ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto"
                RowDefinitions="Auto,Auto">
            <Viewbox x:Name="ContentViewbox"
                     Height="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonContentHeight}"
                     Margin="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonContentViewboxCollapsedMargin}"
                     HorizontalAlignment="Stretch">
              <ContentPresenter x:Name="Content"
                                Content="{TemplateBinding Icon}"
                                Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}">
                <ContentPresenter.Styles>
                  <!-- A path icon as WinUI's, unscaled, so that the Viewbox scales its geometry as WinUI's does (PI-3). -->
                  <Style Selector="PathIcon">
                    <Setter Property="Width" Value="NaN" />
                    <Setter Property="Height" Value="NaN" />
                    <Setter Property="Template" Value="{StaticResource PathIconUnscaledTemplate}" />
                  </Style>
                </ContentPresenter.Styles>
              </ContentPresenter>
            </Viewbox>
            <TextBlock x:Name="TextLabel"
                       Grid.Row="1"
                       Text="{TemplateBinding Label}"
                       Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                       FontSize="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonLabelFontSize}"
                       FontFamily="{TemplateBinding FontFamily}"
                       TextAlignment="Center"
                       TextWrapping="Wrap"
                       Margin="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonTextLabelMargin}" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="OverflowTextLabel"
                       Text="{TemplateBinding Label}"
                       Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                       FontSize="{DynamicResource ControlContentThemeFontSize}"
                       FontFamily="{TemplateBinding FontFamily}"
                       TextAlignment="Left"
                       TextWrapping="NoWrap"
                       HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                       VerticalAlignment="Center"
                       Margin="12,0,12,0"
                       Padding="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonOverflowTextLabelPadding}"
                       IsVisible="False" />
          </Grid>
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>

    <!-- ApplicationViewStates: Compact -->
    <Style Selector="^[IsCompact=True]">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonInnerBorderCompactMargin}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- LabelCollapsed -->
    <Style Selector="^[LabelPosition=Collapsed]">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonInnerBorderMargin}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Grid#ContentRoot">
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarThemeCompactHeight}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- LabelOnRight (and the Width NaN of AppBarButton::CreateStoryboardForWidthAdjustmentsForLabelOnRightStyle) -->
    <Style Selector="^[LabelPosition=Right]">
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="NaN" />
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonInnerBorderMargin}" />
      </Style>
      <!-- The icon and the label centred in the height of the button: the content grid, in the
           middle of the root, which keeps the compact height, and the label bounded by its
           capitals and its baseline (TextLineBounds Tight), so that its capitals are in the middle
           whatever its font (WinUI places both 16 below the top, which lines them up with the
           metrics of Segoe UI only). Deviation (winui-theme/DEVIATIONS.md, G-29). -->
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Viewbox#ContentViewbox">
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="12,0,0,0" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Panel#Root">
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarThemeCompactHeight}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Grid#ContentRoot">
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="0" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
        <Setter Property="Grid.Row" Value="0" />
        <Setter Property="Grid.Column" Value="1" />
        <Setter Property="TextAlignment" Value="Left" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
        <Setter Property="TextLineBounds" Value="Tight" />
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="8,0,12,0" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- Overflow (with the setters of AppBarButtonOverflowStyle) -->
    <Style Selector="^[IsInOverflow=True]">
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="NaN" />
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Grid#ContentRoot">
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="0" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonInnerBorderOverflowMargin}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Viewbox#ContentViewbox, ^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
      </Style>
    </Style>

    <!-- CommonStates: PointerOver (also OverflowPointerOver) -->
    <Style Selector="^:pointerover">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBackgroundPointerOver}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBorderBrushPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel, ^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- Pressed (also OverflowPressed) -->
    <Style Selector="^:pressed">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBackgroundPressed}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBorderBrushPressed}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundPressed}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel, ^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundPressed}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- Disabled -->
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBackgroundDisabled}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBorderBrushDisabled}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundDisabled}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel, ^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundDisabled}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="AppBarButtonOverflowStyle" TargetType="CommandBarButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultAppBarButtonStyle}">
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="NaN" />
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type CommandBarButton}" TargetType="CommandBarButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultAppBarButtonStyle}" />

  <!-- AppBarToggleButton -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="DefaultAppBarToggleButtonStyle" TargetType="CommandBarToggleButton">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackground}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForeground}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderThemeThickness}" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Top" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource ContentControlThemeFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Normal" />
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="68" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}" />
    <Setter Property="BackgroundSizing" Value="InnerBorderEdge" />
    <!-- UseSystemFocusVisuals with FocusVisualMargin="-3". -->
    <Setter Property="FocusAdorner">
      <FocusAdornerTemplate>
        <Border Margin="-3"
                BorderThickness="2"
                BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SystemControlFocusVisualPrimaryBrush}"
                CornerRadius="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}">
          <Border BorderThickness="1"
                  BorderBrush="{DynamicResource SystemControlFocusVisualSecondaryBrush}"
                  CornerRadius="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}" />
        </Border>
      </FocusAdornerTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel x:Name="Root" Background="Transparent">
          <Border x:Name="AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder"
                  Margin="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonInnerBorderMargin}"
                  Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                  BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                  BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                  CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                  BackgroundSizing="{TemplateBinding BackgroundSizing}">
            <Border.Transitions>
              <Transitions>
                <BrushTransition Property="Background" Duration="0:0:0.083" />
              </Transitions>
            </Border.Transitions>
          </Border>
          <Grid x:Name="ContentRoot"
                MinHeight="{DynamicResource AppBarThemeMinHeight}"
                ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto"
                RowDefinitions="Auto,Auto">
            <!-- E73E CheckMark of 16 px in a box of 14 x 14. -->
            <Path x:Name="OverflowCheckGlyph"
                  Data="{StaticResource GlyphGeometryE73E}"
                  Fill="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonCheckGlyphForeground}"
                  Stretch="Uniform"
                  Width="13"
                  HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                  VerticalAlignment="Center"
                  Margin="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowCheckMargin}"
                  Opacity="0"
                  IsVisible="False" />
            <Viewbox x:Name="ContentViewbox"
                     Height="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonContentHeight}"
                     Margin="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonContentViewboxCollapsedMargin}"
                     HorizontalAlignment="Stretch">
              <ContentPresenter x:Name="Content"
                                Content="{TemplateBinding Icon}"
                                Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}">
                <ContentPresenter.Styles>
                  <!-- A path icon as WinUI's, unscaled, so that the Viewbox scales its geometry as WinUI's does (PI-3). -->
                  <Style Selector="PathIcon">
                    <Setter Property="Width" Value="NaN" />
                    <Setter Property="Height" Value="NaN" />
                    <Setter Property="Template" Value="{StaticResource PathIconUnscaledTemplate}" />
                  </Style>
                </ContentPresenter.Styles>
              </ContentPresenter>
            </Viewbox>
            <TextBlock x:Name="TextLabel"
                       Grid.Row="1"
                       Text="{TemplateBinding Label}"
                       Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                       FontSize="12"
                       FontFamily="{TemplateBinding FontFamily}"
                       TextAlignment="Center"
                       TextWrapping="Wrap"
                       Margin="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonTextLabelMargin}" />
            <TextBlock x:Name="OverflowTextLabel"
                       Text="{TemplateBinding Label}"
                       Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                       FontSize="{DynamicResource ControlContentThemeFontSize}"
                       FontFamily="{TemplateBinding FontFamily}"
                       TextAlignment="Left"
                       TextWrapping="NoWrap"
                       HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                       VerticalAlignment="Center"
                       Margin="38,0,12,0"
                       Padding="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowTextLabelPadding}"
                       IsVisible="False" />
          </Grid>
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>

    <!-- ApplicationViewStates: Compact -->
    <Style Selector="^[IsCompact=True]">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonInnerBorderCompactMargin}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- LabelCollapsed -->
    <Style Selector="^[LabelPosition=Collapsed]">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonInnerBorderMargin}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Grid#ContentRoot">
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarThemeCompactHeight}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- LabelOnRight (and the Width NaN of the code's storyboard) -->
    <Style Selector="^[LabelPosition=Right]">
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="NaN" />
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonInnerBorderMargin}" />
      </Style>
      <!-- The icon and the label centred in the height of the button (G-29, as the button). -->
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Viewbox#ContentViewbox">
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="12,0,0,0" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Panel#Root">
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarThemeCompactHeight}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Grid#ContentRoot">
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="0" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
        <Setter Property="Grid.Row" Value="0" />
        <Setter Property="Grid.Column" Value="1" />
        <Setter Property="TextAlignment" Value="Left" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
        <Setter Property="TextLineBounds" Value="Tight" />
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="8,0,12,0" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- Overflow (with the setters of AppBarToggleButtonOverflowStyle) -->
    <Style Selector="^[IsInOverflow=True]">
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="NaN" />
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Grid#ContentRoot">
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="0" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonInnerBorderOverflowMargin}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Viewbox#ContentViewbox, ^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="False" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph, ^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
      </Style>
    </Style>

    <!-- CommonStates: PointerOver -->
    <Style Selector="^:pointerover">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundPointerOver}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
        <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- Pressed -->
    <Style Selector="^:pressed">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundPressed}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushPressed}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundPressed}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundPressed}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
        <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundPressed}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundPressed}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- Disabled -->
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundDisabled}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushDisabled}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundDisabled}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundDisabled}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
        <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundDisabled}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundDisabled}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- Checked -->
    <Style Selector="^:checked">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundChecked}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushChecked}" />
        <Setter Property="BackgroundSizing" Value="OuterBorderEdge" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundChecked}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundChecked}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
        <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="1" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- CheckedPointerOver -->
    <Style Selector="^:checked:pointerover">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundCheckedPointerOver}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushCheckedPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundCheckedPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundCheckedPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
        <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedPointerOver}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- CheckedPressed -->
    <Style Selector="^:checked:pressed">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundCheckedPressed}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushCheckedPressed}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundCheckedPressed}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundCheckedPressed}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
        <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedPressed}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedPressed}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
    <!-- CheckedDisabled -->
    <Style Selector="^:checked:disabled">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundCheckedDisabled}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushCheckedDisabled}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundCheckedDisabled}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundCheckedDisabled}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
        <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedDisabled}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedDisabled}" />
      </Style>
    </Style>

    <!-- The Overflow* states of the CommonStates group, which AppBarToggleButton::ChangeVisualState
         chooses after the ones above for an enabled button in the overflow. -->
    <Style Selector="^[IsInOverflow=True]">
      <!-- OverflowPointerOver -->
      <Style Selector="^:pointerover">
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
          <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundHighLightOverlayPointerOver}" />
          <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushPointerOver}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
          <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonCheckGlyphForegroundPointerOver}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundPointerOver}" />
        </Style>
      </Style>
      <!-- OverflowPressed -->
      <Style Selector="^:pressed">
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
          <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundHighLightOverlayPressed}" />
          <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushPressed}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundPressed}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundPressed}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
          <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonCheckGlyphForegroundPressed}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundPressed}" />
        </Style>
      </Style>
      <!-- OverflowChecked: the background of the button, the foreground of an unchecked one -->
      <Style Selector="^:checked:not(CommandBarToggleButton:disabled)">
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
          <Setter Property="Background" Value="{TemplateBinding Background}" />
          <Setter Property="BackgroundSizing" Value="{TemplateBinding BackgroundSizing}" />
          <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushChecked}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForeground}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel, ^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForeground}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
          <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForeground}" />
        </Style>
      </Style>
      <!-- OverflowCheckedPointerOver -->
      <Style Selector="^:checked:pointerover">
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
          <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundHighLightOverlayCheckedPointerOver}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedPointerOver}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundCheckedPointerOver}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
          <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedPointerOver}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedPointerOver}" />
        </Style>
      </Style>
      <!-- OverflowCheckedPressed -->
      <Style Selector="^:checked:pressed">
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#AppBarToggleButtonInnerBorder">
          <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBackgroundHighLightOverlayCheckedPressed}" />
          <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonBorderBrushCheckedPressed}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ ContentPresenter#Content">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedPressed}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#TextLabel">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonForegroundCheckedPressed}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ Path#OverflowCheckGlyph">
          <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedPressed}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="^ /template/ TextBlock#OverflowTextLabel">
          <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarToggleButtonOverflowLabelForegroundCheckedPressed}" />
        </Style>
      </Style>
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="AppBarToggleButtonOverflowStyle" TargetType="CommandBarToggleButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultAppBarToggleButtonStyle}">
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="NaN" />
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type CommandBarToggleButton}" TargetType="CommandBarToggleButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultAppBarToggleButtonStyle}" />

  <!-- AppBarSeparator -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="DefaultAppBarSeparatorStyle" TargetType="CommandBarSeparator">
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarSeparatorForeground}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarSeparatorMargin}" />
    <Setter Property="IsTabStop" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel x:Name="RootGrid">
          <Rectangle x:Name="SeparatorRectangle"
                     RadiusX="{StaticResource AppBarSeparatorCornerRadius}"
                     RadiusY="{StaticResource AppBarSeparatorCornerRadius}"
                     Width="{StaticResource AppBarSeparatorWidth}"
                     VerticalAlignment="Stretch"
                     Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                     Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}" />
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>

    <!-- ApplicationViewStates: Compact -->
    <Style Selector="^[IsCompact=True] /template/ Panel#RootGrid">
      <Setter Property="Height" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarThemeCompactHeight}" />
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Top" />
    </Style>
    <!-- Overflow -->
    <Style Selector="^[IsInOverflow=True] /template/ Panel#RootGrid">
      <Setter Property="Height" Value="NaN" />
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^[IsInOverflow=True] /template/ Rectangle#SeparatorRectangle">
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="NaN" />
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
      <Setter Property="Height" Value="{StaticResource AppBarOverflowSeparatorHeight}" />
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{StaticResource AppBarOverflowSeparatorMargin}" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type CommandBarSeparator}" TargetType="CommandBarSeparator" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultAppBarSeparatorStyle}" />

  <!-- The More button of the command bar. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="EllipsisButton" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultButtonStyle}">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBackground}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForeground}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBorderBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource ContentControlThemeFontFamily}" />
    <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource ControlContentThemeFontSize}" />
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarExpandButtonThemeWidth}" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}" />
    <!-- FocusVisualMargin="-3": the focus adorner of DefaultButtonStyle. -->
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel Background="Transparent">
          <ContentPresenter x:Name="PART_ContentPresenter"
                            Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                            BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                            BackgroundSizing="InnerBorderEdge"
                            BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                            CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}"
                            Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                            ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding ContentTemplate}"
                            Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                            Margin="{StaticResource AppBarEllipsisButtonInnerBorderMargin}"
                            Padding="0"
                            HorizontalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"
                            VerticalContentAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}" />
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <!-- The foreground of the states is also the foreground of the button, which the ellipsis
         glyph of the command bar follows. -->
    <Style Selector="^:pointerover">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:pressed">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundPressed}" />
    </Style>
    <Style Selector="^:disabled">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundDisabled}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- PointerOver -->
    <Style Selector="^:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBackgroundPointerOver}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundPointerOver}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBorderBrushPointerOver}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- Pressed -->
    <Style Selector="^:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBackgroundPressed}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundPressed}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBorderBrushPressed}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- Disabled -->
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBackgroundDisabled}" />
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonForegroundDisabled}" />
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource AppBarButtonBorderBrushDisabled}" />
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <!-- CommandBarOverflowPresenter: the ItemsControl PART_OverflowPresenter of the command bar. -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="DefaultCommandBarOverflowPresenterStyle" TargetType="ItemsControl">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource CommandBarOverflowPresenterBackground}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource CommandBarOverflowPresenterBorderBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="{DynamicResource CommandBarOverflowPresenterBorderPadding}" />
    <Setter Property="MaxWidth" Value="{DynamicResource CommandBarOverflowMaxWidth}" />
    <Setter Property="ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility" Value="Disabled" />
    <Setter Property="ScrollViewer.VerticalScrollBarVisibility" Value="Auto" />
    <Setter Property="KeyboardNavigation.TabNavigation" Value="Once" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource OverlayCornerRadius}" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Border x:Name="LayoutRoot"
                Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                BackgroundSizing="InnerBorderEdge"
                Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                BorderThickness="{DynamicResource CommandBarOverflowPresenterBorderThickness}"
                CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}">
          <ScrollViewer HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility)}"
                        VerticalScrollBarVisibility="{TemplateBinding (ScrollViewer.VerticalScrollBarVisibility)}">
            <ItemsPresenter Name="PART_ItemsPresenter"
                            ItemsPanel="{TemplateBinding ItemsPanel}"
                            Margin="{DynamicResource CommandBarOverflowPresenterMargin}" />
          </ScrollViewer>
        </Border>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="DefaultCommandBarStyle" TargetType="CommandBar">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource CommandBarBackground}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource CommandBarForeground}" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="4,0,0,0" />
    <Setter Property="IsTabStop" Value="False" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Top" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource ControlCornerRadius}" />
    <!-- The widths FerroUI's CommandBar assumes for an item when it computes the dynamic overflow:
         the Width 68 of DefaultAppBarButtonStyle with the labels at the bottom or collapsed. -->
    <Setter Property="ItemWidthBottom" Value="68" />
    <Setter Property="ItemWidthCollapsed" Value="68" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel x:Name="LayoutRoot">
          <Border x:Name="ContentRoot"
                  VerticalAlignment="Top"
                  MinHeight="{DynamicResource AppBarThemeCompactHeight}"
                  Background="{TemplateBinding Background}">
            <Grid>
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" MinWidth="{StaticResource AppBarMoreButtonColumnMinWidth}" />
              </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                <ContentPresenter x:Name="PART_ContentPresenter"
                                  Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                                  Content="{TemplateBinding Content}"
                                  Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                                  HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                  VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                  HorizontalContentAlignment="Left"
                                  VerticalContentAlignment="Top" />
                <ItemsControl x:Name="PrimaryItemsControl"
                              Grid.Column="1"
                              HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                              MinHeight="{DynamicResource AppBarThemeCompactHeight}"
                              IsTabStop="False"
                              ItemsSource="{Binding VisiblePrimaryCommands, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                  <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                    <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                      <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" />
                    </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                  </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                </ItemsControl>
              </Grid>
              <Button x:Name="PART_OverflowButton"
                      Grid.Column="1"
                      Theme="{StaticResource EllipsisButton}"
                      Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                      MinHeight="{DynamicResource AppBarThemeCompactHeight}"
                      VerticalAlignment="Top"
                      IsVisible="{TemplateBinding IsOverflowButtonVisible}">
                <!-- E712 More of 20 px, as high as AppBarExpandButtonCircleDiameter. -->
                <Path x:Name="EllipsisIcon"
                      Data="{StaticResource GlyphGeometryE712}"
                      Fill="{Binding $parent[Button].Foreground}"
                      Stretch="Uniform"
                      Width="15"
                      Height="{DynamicResource AppBarExpandButtonCircleDiameter}"
                      VerticalAlignment="Center" />
              </Button>
              <Rectangle x:Name="HighContrastBorder"
                         Grid.ColumnSpan="2"
                         IsVisible="False"
                         VerticalAlignment="Stretch"
                         Stroke="{DynamicResource CommandBarHighContrastBorder}"
                         StrokeThickness="1" />
              <Border x:Name="OpenBorder"
                      Grid.ColumnSpan="2"
                      IsVisible="False"
                      VerticalAlignment="Stretch"
                      BorderThickness="{DynamicResource CommandBarBorderThicknessOpen}"
                      BorderBrush="{DynamicResource CommandBarBorderBrushOpen}"
                      CornerRadius="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}" />
            </Grid>
          </Border>
          <Popup x:Name="PART_OverflowPopup"
                 IsOpen="{TemplateBinding IsOpen, Mode=TwoWay}"
                 PlacementTarget="{Binding #ContentRoot}"
                 Placement="BottomEdgeAlignedRight"
                 IsLightDismissEnabled="True"
                 WindowManagerAddShadowHint="False">
            <Border x:Name="SecondaryItemsControlShadowWrapper"
                    BoxShadow="{DynamicResource ThemeShadowFlyoutBoxShadow}"
                    Margin="{StaticResource ThemeShadowFlyoutMargin}"
                    CornerRadius="{DynamicResource OverlayCornerRadius}">
              <ItemsControl x:Name="PART_OverflowPresenter"
                            Theme="{StaticResource DefaultCommandBarOverflowPresenterStyle}"
                            IsTabStop="False"
                            ItemsSource="{Binding OverflowItems, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                  <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                    <StackPanel />
                  </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
              </ItemsControl>
            </Border>
          </Popup>
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>

    <!-- CommonStates: Disabled -->
    <Style Selector="^:disabled /template/ Path#EllipsisIcon">
      <Setter Property="Fill" Value="{DynamicResource CommandBarEllipsisIconForegroundDisabled}" />
    </Style>
    <!-- DisplayModeStates: CompactOpenDown and CompactOpenUp (the overflow is open) -->
    <Style Selector="^[IsOpen=True]">
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#ContentRoot">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource CommandBarBackgroundOpen}" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{TemplateBinding CornerRadius}" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Border#OpenBorder, ^ /template/ Rectangle#HighContrastBorder">
        <Setter Property="IsVisible" Value="True" />
      </Style>
      <Style Selector="^ /template/ Button#PART_OverflowButton">
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
      </Style>
    </Style>
  </ControlTheme>

  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type CommandBar}" TargetType="CommandBar" BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultCommandBarStyle}" />
</ResourceDictionary>
